<title>UK: ICI cuts fertiliser prices - FT.</title>
<headline>ICI cuts fertiliser prices - FT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICI Fertilizers, a unit of Imperial Chemical Industries Plc, has cut its prices of ammonium nitrate fertilisers because of cheap Russian imports, the Financial Times said.</p>
<p>In its Monday edition, the newspaper said the price to farmers would drop to 110 stg or less per tonne from around 125 stg at present.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
